This directory contains the text (no pictures!) of the PWB/UNIX
Operations Manual.
You are encouraged to add information specific to your site in
sections 11 and 12 ("Contacts" and "Local Procedures," respectively).
To get a copy of this manual on a terminal, utter:
         neqn /usr/man/op/uom* | nroff -rB1 -muom -
To get a typeset copy, say:
         eqn /usr/man/op/uom* | troff -rB1 -muom -
